DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261113
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261114
SUMMARY:Workshop on Behavioural Macroeconomics and Finance
LOCATION:London
DESCRIPTION:イングランド銀行とLSEによる行動マクロ経済学・金融の研究ワークショップ(第2回)。 / 主催: Bank of England and London School of Economics / https://www.bankofengland.co.uk/events/2026/november/2nd-boe-lse-workshop-on-behavioural-macro-and-finance / 登壇: James Bullard (Purdue)\, Chih Han Hsueh (USW)\, Giovanni Cirigliano (Tor Vergata)\, Wentong Chen (Santa Clara)\, Alp Simsek (Yale)\, Alessia Papini (EUI)\, Lovisa Reiche (BI)\, Francesco Amodeo (JHU)
